msgstr "Chofoza u-'Qhubeka' ukuze ususe Amamethrikhi alandelayo.  Isaziso: Uma kungekho amanye Amamethrikhi asele ngemva kwale nqubo, Isifanekiso Sombiko sizokhiywa ngokuzenzakalelayo."

#: templates.php
msgid "List of selected measurands:"
msgstr "Uhlu lwezinto ezikalwayo ezikhethiwe:"

#: templates.php
#, php-format
msgid "Metric: %s"
msgstr "Imethrikhi: %s"

#: templates.php
msgid "You must select at least one measurand."
msgstr "Kufanele ukhethe okungenani into ekalwayo (measurand) eyodwa."

#: templates.php
msgid "Delete Template Metrics"
msgstr "Susa Amamethrikhi Esifanekiso"

#: templates.php
#, php-format
msgid "Variables [ Template: %s - %s ]"
msgstr "Okuguquguqukayo [ Isifanekiso: %s - %s ]"

#: templates.php
msgid "No Variables Found"
msgstr "Azikho Iziguquguquki Ezitholakele"

#: templates.php
#, php-format
msgid "Variable Configuration [ edit: %s ]"
msgstr "Ukucushwa Kokuguquguqukayo [ hlela: %s ]"

#: templates.php
msgid "Variable Configuration [new]"
msgstr "Ukucushwa Kokuguquguqukayo [okusha]"

#: templates.php
msgid "Internal name"
msgstr "Igama langaphakathi"

#: templates.php
msgid "A unique identifier which will be created by ReportIt itself. Use this ID within the definition of your calculation formulas to include that value the report user has defined individually for it."
msgstr "Isikhombi esihlukile esizokwakhiwa yi-ReportIt ngokwayo. Sebenzisa le ID ngaphakathi kwencazelo yamafomula akho okubala ukuze ufake lelo nani elichazwe ngumsebenzisi wombiko ngamunye."

#: templates.php
msgid "A name like \"Threshold\" for example which should be used as a headline within the report config."
msgstr "Igama elinjengelithi \"Umkhawulo\" ngokwesibonelo okufanele lisetshenziswe njengesihloko esikhulu ngaphakathi kokulungiselelwa kombiko."

#: templates.php
msgid "Provide a name for this Variable"
msgstr "Nikeza igama lalesi Siguquguquki"

#: templates.php
msgid "A description that explains the sense of this variable."
msgstr "Incazelo echaza umqondo walesi siguquko."

#: templates.php
msgid "Provide a meaningful description"
msgstr "Nikeza incazelo enomqondo"

#: templates.php
msgid "Maximum Value"
msgstr "Inani Eliphezulu"

#: templates.php
msgid "Defines the upper limit of this variable."
msgstr "Ichaza umkhawulo ophezulu walokhu okuguquguqukayo."

#: templates.php
msgid "Minimum Value"
msgstr "Inani Elincane Kakhulu"

#: templates.php
msgid "Defines the lower limit of this variable."
msgstr "Ichaza umkhawulo ophansi walokhu okuguquguqukayo."

#: templates.php
msgid "Default Value"
msgstr "Inani Elizenzakalelayo"

#: templates.php
msgid "Sets the default value."
msgstr "Isetha inani elimisiwe."

#: templates.php view.php
msgid "Type"
msgstr "Uhlobo"

#: templates.php
msgid "The method the report owner should use to define this variable."
msgstr "Indlela umnikazi wombiko okufanele ayisebenzise ukuchaza lokhu okuguqukayo."

#: templates.php
msgid "Defines the distance between two values if method \"DropDown\" has been chosen. Please ensure that this value is not set too low, because it defines indirectly the number of options the dropdown field will have. For example the following parameters: MAX:100, MIN:0, STEP:0.01  will result in a select box of 10.001 options. This can cause dramatical performance issues due to a high CPU load at the clients side. Try to keep it under 1000."
msgstr "Ichaza ibanga phakathi kwamanani amabili uma kukhethwe indlela ethi \"DropDown\". Sicela uqinisekise ukuthi leli nani alibekwa phansi kakhulu, ngoba lichaza ngokungaqondile inani lezinketho inkambu yokudonsela phansi ezoba nazo. Ngokwesibonelo lezi zinhlaka ezilandelayo: MAX:100, MIN:0, STEP:0.01  zizodala ibhokisi lokukhetha elinezinketho ezingu-10.001. Lokhu kungabangela izinkinga ezinkulu zokusebenza ngenxa yomthwalo omkhulu we-CPU ohlangothini lwamakhasimende. Zama ukukugcina ngaphansi kwe-1000."

#: templates.php
#, php-format
msgid "Metric Configuration [ edit: %s - %s ]"
msgstr "Ukumiswa Kwemethrikhi [ hlela: %s - %s ]"

#: templates.php
msgid "Metric Configuration [new]"
msgstr "Ukumiswa Kwemethrikhi [okusha]"

#: templates.php
msgid "The explanation given to this measurand. This will be shown as legend within exports as well as a tooltip within the presentation of a report itself."
msgstr "Incazelo enikezwe lesi silinganiso. Lokhu kuzoboniswa njengencazelo yezimpawu ekuthunyelweni kwedatha kanye njengomlayezo wokusiza ekwethulweni kombiko ngokwawo."

#: templates.php
msgid "Define a unique abbreviation for this measurand with max. 8 letters/numbers."
msgstr "Chaza isifinyezo esihlukile salokhu okulinganiswayo esinezinhlamvu/izinombolo ezingeqile kwezingu-8."

#: templates.php
msgid "The unit given to this measurand. e.g. 'Bits/s'"
msgstr "Iyunithi enikezwe lesi silinganiso. isib. 'Bits/s'"

#: templates.php
msgid "Consolidation function"
msgstr "Umsebenzi wokuhlanganisa"

#: templates.php
msgid "The name of the consolidation function to define which CDPs should be read out."
msgstr "Igama lomsebenzi wokuhlanganisa ukuchaza ukuthi yimaphi ama-CDP okufanele afundwe."

#: templates.php
msgid "Choose 'enable' if this measurand should be become part of the final report output. Leave it unflagged if this measurands will only be used as an auxiliary calculation."
msgstr "Khetha u-'enable' uma lesi silinganiso kufanele sibe yingxenye yomphumela wombiko wokugcina. Siyeke singamakiwe uma lesi silinganiso sizosetshenziswa njengokubala okusizayo kuphela."

#: templates.php
msgid "Choose 'enable' if this measurand will only have one result in total instead of one for every Data Source Item. It's result<br>will be shown separately. Use this option in combination with \"Visible\" = \"off\" if you are looking for a measurand keeping an interim result only that should be reused within the calculation of other measurands without being visible for end users."
msgstr "Khetha u-'enable' uma lesi silinganiso sizoba nomphumela owodwa kuphela sekukonke esikhundleni sokuba nowodwa kuYinto Ngayinye Yomthombo Wedatha. Umphumela waso<br>uzoboniswa ngokwehlukana. Sebenzisa le nketho kanye nokuthi \"Visible\" = \"off\" uma ufuna isilinganiso esigcina umphumela wesikhashana kuphela okufanele siphinde sisetshenziswe ekubalweni kwezinye izilinganiso ngaphandle kokubonakala kubasebenzisi bokugcina."

#: templates.php
msgid "Formatting"
msgstr "Ukufometha"

#: templates.php
msgid "Defines as what type the data should be treated as."
msgstr "Ichaza ukuthi idatha kufanele iphathwe njengaluphi uhlobo."

#: templates.php
msgid "Precision"
msgstr "Ukunemba"

#: templates.php
msgid "Defines how many decimal digits should be displayed for floating-point numbers."
msgstr "Ichaza ukuthi mangaki amadijithi edesimali okufanele aboniswe kwezinombolo ezinamaphoyinti antantayo."

#: templates.php
msgid "Prefixes"
msgstr "Iziqalo"

#: templates.php
msgid "Choose the type of prefix being used to format the result. With the use of decimal prefixes '1024' will be formatted to '1.024k' while the binary prefixes option returns '1ki'. Select 'off' to display the raw data, here '1024'."
msgstr "Khetha uhlobo lwesiqalo olusetshenziselwa ukufometha umphumela. Ngokusebenzisa iziqalo zedesimali u-'1024' uzofomethwa abe ngu-'1.024k' kanti inketho yeziqalo zikanambambili ibuyisa u-'1ki'. Khetha u-'off' ukuze kuboniswe idatha engalungisiwe, lapha u-'1024'."

#: templates.php
msgid "Formula"
msgstr "Ifomula"

#: templates.php
msgid "The mathematical definition of this measurand. Allowed are all combinations of operators and operands listed below following the rules of mathematics. Use round and square brackets to signify complex terms and the order of operations."
msgstr "Incazelo yezibalo yalesi silinganiso. Kuvunyelwe zonke izinhlanganisela zezisebenzisi namanani okusebenza abhalwe ngezansi ngokulandela imithetho yezibalo. Sebenzisa abakaki abayindilinga nabayisikwele ukukhombisa amagama ayinkimbinkimbi kanye nokuhleleka kokusebenza."

#: templates.php
msgid "Operators & Operands"
msgstr "Ama-Opharetha nama-Opherandi"

#: templates.php
msgid "Click on one of the listed operators or operand to append them to your calucalion formula. The tooltip will show you additional information like description, return value, arguments and usage."
msgstr "Chofoza ku-opharetha noma i-operand eyodwa esohlwini ukuze uyifake ekugcineni kwefomula yakho yokubala. Ithulithiphu izokubonisa ulwazi olwengeziwe njengencazelo, inani elibuyayo, ama-argument kanye nokusetshenziswa."

